/-!
# Round six, Proposition 18: the assembly (`P18IL6`)

**`p18Body6_of`**: from the uniform Proposition 14 in its explicit-hypothesis form
(`IL3.P14UH' tab Ew P.lamp`, with a guard `EwOK6 P Ew`) the body `P18Body6 P tab`.

The table is `IL.kTableP tab (ext6 nU U e su td q)` (`R6P18Tab`): the Proposition 14 procedures,
a copy of the frozen Lemma 12 procedure with the frozen uniform swap `KFW.swGU q` on it (so the
frozen layout programs and their correctness proofs are reused unchanged, with the frozen swap
exponent `τS`), and the frozen body `body18`. At round six `K = ℓ - 1`, so the swap is never
called and its exponent does not enter the cost (`R6P18Lay`); the cost is `cost6`
(`R6P18Cost`), the side conditions `par6` (`R6P18Par`), the chunk rounds `chunkU_of6`
(`R6P18Chunk`), setup and teardown the frozen `S18M.setup18Need`, the error the frozen
`KFM.err18Need` (`2 N (3ℓ+1) 2^{-p} ≤ 2^{⌊p/2⌋} 2^{-p}` since `N ≤ 2^{(d-1)ℓ}`).

**`p18IL6`**: `P18IL6 P` for every admissible `P` (through `IL3.P14UH.toH'`).
-/

